<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">Hi <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;text-align:center;
line-height:normal"><b><i><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin;color:#374151">Did you know?</span></i></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;color:#374151"> </span><b><i>One in three
African American blood donors are a match for people with sickle cell disease.</i></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="color: rgb(55, 65, 81); font-size: 12pt;">Blood
donations are essential during summer to help sickle cell patients. The
American Red Cross relies on Black community leaders like you to fulfill our
mission of providing compatible blood to patients fighting sickle cell disease.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">I wanted
to reach out to you, as one of those leaders, to invite you to join our
lifesaving efforts. My name is </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;Name&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> and I am an American Red Cross &lt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">Account Manager, Sickle Cell
Account Manager, Area Booking Manager</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt;.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hosting a
summer blood drive ensures an adequate supply of blood products to support
patients through the season.&nbsp; Blood
donations from individuals who are Black are especially valuable, as they uniquely
support those with sickle cell disease.&nbsp; During
the summer months when blood donations tend to drop, sickle cell patients are still
relying on blood donors to donate blood.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">June offers
a special time of recognition, with </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://vimeo.com/696167273/ac3155272a">Dr. Charles R. Drew’s<span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;
font-weight:normal"></span></a><a class="msocomanchor" id="_anchor_1" href="https://americanredcross.sharepoint.com/teams/SponsorMarketingTeam/Shared%20Documents/General/Segments/Diversity/African%20American/Diversity%20Calendar/Charles%20Drew%20Bday-World%20Sickle%20Cell%20Day-Juneteenth/2024/Diversity%20Calendar%20-%20Outlook%20Email%20Templates%20-%20June%202024.docx#_msocom_1" language="JavaScript" name="_msoanchor_1">[FR1]</a>&nbsp;</b><b style="font-size: 12pt;">
birthday<a></a></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> on June
3 and </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">World Sickle Cell Awareness Day</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> and </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Juneteenth</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> on June 19.
It’s the perfect time to highlight Black communities coming together — and what
better way to celebrate community than by hosting a blood drive to support
those in the community battling ailments such as sickle cell disease?</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We would
love to partner with you. Will you consider hosting a Red Cross blood drive
this summer?</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Let’s find
time to talk. Would &lt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">Day
of Week</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt; of this week work, or would next week be better?</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"></p><div>

